  "kernel": "1e2efe287635ddbd1d95cb998d67dbcbe23fb89f",
  "kernel_repo": "Aiden-HQ/AidenHQ",
  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: code-review, tasks. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "The Researcher posts the owner's Primer digest each morning",
    "No idle agent-held task: task_wait and an idle sweep",
    "Every open task has a holder, an agent or the owner",
    "An agent that reviews pull requests",
    "Pause a routine failing 3 times in a row and raise missed fires",
    "A refused run never blocks its task on a parent that waits on it, and a failing outcome post backs off",
    "A replaces successor is diffed against its predecessor's authority too",
    "Code host steps recorded only after they happen; starter seed, outside-PR scrub and CI breaker restored",
    "A connection proxy restart no longer reads as signed out, and a one-off review runs once its org applies",
    "Nothing a task is owed is dropped between wakes, jobs and grades",
    "Job alerts and panels read the kernel's job metrics",
    "A failed update tells the owner the host reverted",
    "A device sign-in belongs to the admin account, not one browser session",
    "Agent failure alerts name the cause (402 credits, 401 key)",
    "An Engineer's .aidenhq/out files are attached to its task when the job ends",
    "Product writes pass the product gate and are tiered by path again",
    "The product-bug step asks for the issue to be filed",
    "A stale-PR nudge goes to the task that owns the branch",
    "The PR watcher closes cancelled tasks' PRs, wakes on red heads, re-runs unstarted checks, updates behind branches, caps its wakes"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.19.9"
}
